ith `--now`.","startLine":83,"endLine":83,"text":"owo sync start --session <id> --transcript <path> [--format jsonl|claude-jsonl|opencode-json] [--every N] [--now] parses user and assistant text, reads the bookmark in <root>/.owo/sessions/<id>.json, and counts new user turns. A run is due at --every turns (default identity.json sync_every, else 6), or at any new turn with --now."},{"markdown":"When due it writes the slice, with two earlier user turns as overlap, to `<root>/sources/<slug>/<date>_<session>_<from>-<until>.md`, and the ingest prompt to `.owo/sessions/<id>.prompt.md`. `owo sync done --session <id> --until <n>` moves the bookmark forward; `--until` may not pass the message count the last `sync start` read. The prompt names the absolute root and runs `context --no-touch`, so ingest runs do not count as project sessions. `--project` must name an existing project. A file with no user or assistant messages for the chosen format fails. While a run is pending, a not-due `sync start` names its prompt.","startLine":85,"endLine":85,"text":"When due it writes the slice, with two earlier user turns as overlap, to <root>/sources/<slug>/<date>_<session>_<from>-<until>.md, and the ingest prompt to .owo/sessions/<id>.prompt.md. owo sync done --session <id> --until <n> moves the bookmark forward; --until may not pass the message count the last sync start read. The prompt names the absolute root and runs context --no-touch, so ingest runs do not count as project sessions. --project must name an existing project. A file with no user or assistant messages for the chosen format fails. While a run is pending, a not-due sync start names its prompt."}],"blocks":[{"type":"heading","start":0,"end":5,"startLine":1,"endLine":1,"children":[]},{"type":"paragraph","start":7,"end":121,"startLine":3,"endLine":3,"children":[]},{"type":"heading","start":123,"end":132,"startLine":5,"endLine":5,"children":[]},{"type":"paragraph","start":134,"end":235,"startLine":7,"endLine":7,"children":[]}